# Sheet drops are local only. Never commit game data pulled out of Google Sheets.
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx

# Picture drops are local only too, for the same reason and one of its own: the
# folders are the *originals*, 2048x2048 and 2.4 MB apiece, and 27 of them is
# 66 MB. What ships is what `npm run art:items` cuts from them into
# public/items/ — 0.84 MB, committed on purpose. Keeping both would put the
# whole 66 MB in the clone to serve none of it.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp

# The templates and the schema notes are the importer's contract, so they stay tracked.
!templates/*.csv
